  "description_en": "Supports structured recognition and output of fields such as ticket number, departure station, arrival station, departure time, fare, seat type, passenger information, seat number, and train number.  \nAfter the update on 2024-12-31, electronic train tickets are supported, and the following new fields are added to the response: electronic ticket number, buyer name, buyer unified credit code, title, invoice date, and remarks",
